// PPO training-loop hyperparameters (category 1: affect only the gradient
// update / rollout collection — never persisted in a checkpoint, ignored at
// inference). These values match the compiled `PpoHyperparams::default()`.
// Pass with: train_ppo --ppo-config assets/training/default.ppo.ron
//
// Optional `seed: Some(<u64>)` fixes burn's backend RNG (weight init +
// sampling noise), the minibatch-shuffle RNG, and per-env episode resets —
// giving a run an exactly reproducible starting point (not necessarily every
// later iteration; see `PpoHyperparams::seed`'s doc comment). Omitted here
// (defaults to `None`, i.e. unseeded) — a CLI `--seed` overrides whatever
// this field is set to.
(
    gamma: 0.99,
    gae_lambda: 0.95,
    clip_epsilon: 0.2,
    value_coef: 0.5,
    entropy_coef: 0.01,
    lr: 0.0003,
    rollout_steps: 2048,
    n_epochs: 4,
    minibatch: 64,
    // seed: Some(1234),
)
